sequenceDiagram
    participant U as Browser
    participant V as Task view + form
    participant S as Task service
    participant M as MongoDB

    U->>V: POST change + version
    V->>V: CSRF + login + access
    V->>M: Scoped task lookup
    M-->>V: Visible task or 404
    V->>S: Validated update or claim<br/>with expected version
    S->>M: Reload visible task
    M-->>S: State + version N

    S->>S: Check version + authority<br/>Validate resulting task
    Note over V,M: Officer: details / delegation. Assignee: status only.<br/>Claim: committee member + unassigned + unfinished.<br/>Rejected access, invalid data or stale version stop before writing.
    S->>S: Build changed fields + audit
    S->>M: Conditional task update<br/>id + version N predicate
    Note over S,M: SET state + history + updated_at<br/>SET version N+1<br/>One atomic task document update
    alt exactly one document matched
        M-->>S: matched_count = 1
        S-->>V: Persisted task
        V-->>U: HTTP 302, task detail
    else no document matched
        M-->>S: matched_count = 0
        S-->>V: TaskConflict, no overwrite
        V-->>U: HTTP 409, reload task
    end
